# Spr_EmitStreamLinked: the corpus never draws a vertically flipped carrier, nor finds the
# hardware sprite list full.
# vflip: flags bit 3 (the word at arg0 is flags << 8 | frame; bit 3 is clear at every corpus call).
case vflip
w arg0 = [arg0-2]+$800

# full: the slot the write pointer (g_SprWritePtr, $FFE21A) links to is 80, the sentinel: the
# first piece that is on screen ends it all with -1.
case full
b [$FFE21A]+3 = $50
